# Frontend Environment Configuration Example
# In development, the Vite proxy handles /api -> http://127.0.0.1:8000
# For production deployment on Vercel, set your deployed backend API URL:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
# Production Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://placement-readiness-api.onrender.com/api
